<title>MALAYSIA: Hospital Pantai stock suspended-KLSE.</title>
<headline>Hospital Pantai stock suspended-KLSE.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-07-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>The stock of hospital operator Hospital Pantai Bhd was suspended on Tuesday at the company's request, an official at the Kuala Lumpur Stock Exchange said.</p>
<p>Officials at the company could not immediately be reached for comment. Shares of the company closed at 28.75 ringgit on Monday.</p>
<p>The private hospital operator is controlled by Mokhzani Mahathir, who also runs diversified Tongkah Holdings Bhd.</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603 206 2323)</p>
</text>
